<title>PHILIPPINES: Petron cuts diesel price by 67 ctvs/litre.</title>
<headline>Petron cuts diesel price by 67 ctvs/litre.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Petron Corp announced on Friday a reduction in most petroleum products with diesel experiencing the biggest cut of 67 centavos per litre.</p>
<p>The company said the adjustments will take effect on March 10.</p>
</text>
